Sibling projects (MIT License, same author)
notes-pocketbook (PB Notes), nextcloud-pocketbook (PB Cloud), office-pocketbook (PB Office). The defensive JSON reader
(core/src/json.cpp) and the test helpers (tests/support/tmp_dir.h, tls_test_server.h) were adapted from notes-pocketbook.
